 "notes": "Endless survival setup modal. Left column: ROUTE carousel card (King's Road picture well with a parchment name plaque fading into the art on its right, crest banner hanging over the art, prev/next chevrons on the left/right edges, six page diamonds straddling the bottom edge; dot 1 is filled gold = current route, dots 2-6 are hollow outlines). OPENING BOON row of three choice cards; card 1 (Surplus Courage) is SELECTED: bright orange glowing frame with an outer glow ~7px beyond the rect, while cards 2 and 3 have plain thin brass frames. Card widths in the concept are uneven (173/163/175) and card 1 sits 2px higher with its text 2px higher. Each card: picture well on top that fades into the dark text area at ~y487, centred name, divider (hairline with centre diamond), centred 1-3 description lines. FIELD GUIDE and RUN HISTORY are slate-blue secondary buttons; BACK is a dark secondary button with a chevron and overlaps the modal's bottom frame. Right column: YOUR WARBAND heading with a small crest pennant and EDIT WARBAND button; six unit cards with a gold number tab in the top-left (tab bottom-right corner is curved), unit figure, class icon + Lv text, and four level diamonds (first filled gold, three hollow). SPELLS strip: flame icon + label, five square spell slots each with a blue gem badge overlapping the bottom edge; the strip's top/bottom hairlines end where the decorative camp scene (banner, lantern, helmet, map table; 'scene' rect) overlaps on the right. The primary BEGIN ENDLESS MARCH button is a parchment-gold slab with crossed swords icon, label, vertical divider, roast food icon and the cost '4' (larger, lower baseline) + 'FOOD'. The header band is dark blue with a castle panorama fading in from about x690 to the close button; helmet crest at left, compass-rose ornament after the title."
}